OL,3,GNEWSA'My brother died, so I smashed up
OL,4,Ahis TV'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Ellie Goudie's brother Ryan died
OL,7,Faged 23, she could not bear the thought
OL,8,Fof anyone else having his belongings.
OL,10,FInstead, she paid to smash them to
OL,11,Fpieces.
OL,13,FArmed with a baseball bat in a Swindon
OL,14,Frage room, Ellie destroyed some of the
OL,15,Fpossessions Ryan had left behind,
OL,16,Fincluding his beloved television,
OL,17,Fsaying it helped her cope with the pain
OL,18,Fof losing him.
OL,20,F"That was his. He can't have it any
OL,21,Fmore, so no one should," she said.
